  <ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock id="HH22FBAEA0509E80B804A4341B1670898A" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Company is involved in various claims and legal proceedings of a nature considered normal to its business. The claims are in various stages and some may ultimately be brought to trial.&amp;#160; While it is not feasible to predict or determine the outcome of any of these claims, it is the opinion of management that final outcome of these claims will not materially impact the Company's financial position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfMateriallyImportantTransactionsOfTheRespondentNotDisclosedElsewhereTextBlock id="HH582A4E700260C05D782FA2D6F218758A" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;NA&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfMateriallyImportantTransactionsOfTheRespondentNotDisclosedElsewhereTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantChangesRelatedToRespondentCompanyAppearingInAnnualReportToStockholdersTextBlock id="HHFB056E8F64ABA7B86B31B31B7725CE20" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;NA&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantChangesRelatedToRespondentCompanyAppearingInAnnualReportToStockholdersTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="HHC9E9219375AC2F82A8CDFAF00D88FECC" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Gordon van Welie, ISO New England's Chief Executive Officer (CEO), retired effective December 31, 2025, and was replaced by Vamsi Chadalavada who assumed the role of CEO effective January 1, 2026.&amp;#160; Prior to Dr. Chadalavada's appointment to CEO he held the role of Chief Operating Officer.&amp;#160; Robert C. Ludlow, ISO New England's Chief Financial and Compliance Officer, retired effective December 31, 2025, and was replaced by Kelly C. Reyngold, who assumed the role of Chief Financial Officer (CFO) effective January 1, 2026.&amp;#160; Prior to Ms. Reyngold's appointment to CFO she held the role of Director, Accounting.&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
